@startuml Filter Class by Academic Year
actor User
participant ": ClassManagementPage " as ClassManagementPage
participant ": ClassGroupService " as ClassGroupService
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": ClassGroupController " as ClassGroupController
participant ": ClassGroupService " as BackendService
participant ": ClassGroupRepository " as ClassGroupRepository
database Database

User->ClassManagementPage: 1. User selects Academic Year from dropdown
    activate User
activate ClassManagementPage
ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 2. Update selectedAcademicYearId state
ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 3. Trigger useEffect on academicYearId change
ClassManagementPage->ClassGroupService: 4. Call getByAcademicYear(academicYearId, token)
deactivate ClassManagementPage
activate ClassGroupService
ClassGroupService->Router: 5. Send GET /api/classgroup/by-academic-year/{academicYearId}
deactivate ClassGroupService
activate Router
Router->ClassGroupController: 6. Route Request to Controller
deactivate Router
activate ClassGroupController
ClassGroupController->ClassGroupController: 7. Create ClassGroupFilterDto with AcademicYearId
ClassGroupController->BackendService: 8. Call GetClassesByFilterAsync(filter)
deactivate ClassGroupController
activate BackendService
BackendService->ClassGroupRepository: 9. Get Classes by Filter
activate ClassGroupRepository
ClassGroupRepository->Database: 10. Query ClassGroup WHERE AcademicYearId = {id}
activate Database
Database-->ClassGroupRepository: 11. Return Filtered Class Records
deactivate Database
ClassGroupRepository->Database: 12. Query ClassGroupMembers (JOIN) for student count
activate Database
Database-->ClassGroupRepository: 13. Return Student Count per Class
deactivate Database
ClassGroupRepository->Database: 14. Query AcademicYear (JOIN) for year name
activate Database
Database-->ClassGroupRepository: 15. Return AcademicYear Name
deactivate Database
ClassGroupRepository-->BackendService: 16. Return ClassGroup Entities with Relations
deactivate ClassGroupRepository
BackendService->BackendService: 17. Map Entities to ClassGroupDto
BackendService->BackendService: 18. Calculate CurrentStudentCount for each class
BackendService-->ClassGroupController: 19. Return IEnumerable<ClassGroupDto>
deactivate BackendService
activate ClassGroupController
ClassGroupController->ClassGroupController: 20. Wrap in ResponseDto<IEnumerable<ClassGroupDto>>
ClassGroupController-->Router: 21. Send Success Response with Filtered Classes
activate Router
deactivate ClassGroupController
Router-->ClassGroupService: 22. Return Response Data
activate ClassGroupService
deactivate Router
ClassGroupService->ClassGroupService: 23. Extract data from response
ClassGroupService-->ClassManagementPage: 24. Return Filtered Classes List
activate ClassManagementPage
deactivate ClassGroupService
ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 25. Update classes state with filtered data
ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 26. Group classes by grade for display
ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 27. Re-render component with filtered classes
ClassManagementPage-->User: 28. Display Filtered Classes by Academic Year
deactivate ClassManagementPage
deactivate User

alt Error occurs
    BackendService-->ClassGroupController: Error Response
    activate ClassGroupController
    deactivate BackendService
    ClassGroupController->ClassGroupController: Wrap Error in ResponseDto
    ClassGroupController-->Router: Send Error Response (400/500)
    activate Router
    deactivate ClassGroupController
    Router-->ClassGroupService: Return Error Response
    activate ClassGroupService
    deactivate Router
    ClassGroupService-->ClassManagementPage: Error Data
    activate ClassManagementPage
    deactivate ClassGroupService
    ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: Show Error Toast
    ClassManagementPage-->User: Display Error Message
    deactivate ClassManagementPage
    deactivate User
end
@enduml


